[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 4981.589, "timestamp": "01:23:01", "text": "我說看這真的太累了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4982.179, "timestamp": "01:23:02", "text": "那場比賽。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4985.305, "timestamp": "01:23:05", "text": "你就是這麼說的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4994.719, "timestamp": "01:23:14", "text": "很有趣。你可知道？就這樣吧"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4996.922, "timestamp": "01:23:16", "text": "經過。我認為我們會玩皮科，因為"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4999.074, "timestamp": "01:23:19", "text": "我覺得玩大師級對決模式會很棒。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5001.592, "timestamp": "01:23:21", "text": "頭痛。因為？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5002.409, "timestamp": "01:23:22", "text": "是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5006.143, "timestamp": "01:23:26", "text": "是的，因為它包含的東西太多了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5008.789, "timestamp": "01:23:28", "text": "通過。更不用說每"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5011.444, "timestamp": "01:23:31", "text": "那個該死的人是個威脅。而且沒有"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5013.379, "timestamp": "01:23:33", "text": "提到大家都會丟東西"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5014.395, "timestamp": "01:23:34", "text": "聊天中的侮辱。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5019.22, "timestamp": "01:23:39", "text": "哦，還有那個。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5025.743, "timestamp": "01:23:45", "text": "是的。這些人真是太糟糕了。你知道為什麼嗎？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5027.28, "timestamp": "01:23:47", "text": "我為什麼離開？我離開是因為…"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5028.26, "timestamp": "01:23:48", "text": "毒性太大。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5035.128, "timestamp": "01:23:55", "text": "或許。多人遊戲"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5035.761, "timestamp": "01:23:55", "text": "通常，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5039.602, "timestamp": "01:23:59", "text": "你已經知道了。我很少感到壓力，對吧？ 你知道？我生活中沒什麼壓力。"}]